2 CONT **daughter of JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and NICOLASA DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-ROCHA. She was born 30 Jun 1671 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT **:A.K.A. Antonia Guajardo.
2 CONT
