2 CONT 6.  Felipe De La Garza Falcon URIBE1 (Luisa Gonzales De La Garza FALCON, Blas Maria  Trevino De La Garza, Marcos Alonzo Garza Y del Arcon) was born 1666. Felipe married Maria Diaz De La Garza FALCON, daughter of Melchor Gonzales D
2 CONC e La Garza  FALCON and Laureana DIAZ. Maria was born 1669. She died 1755.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT *1. 67 F i. Catarina De La Garza Falcon URIBE 
2 CONT **was born 1711 in El Valle del Carrizal, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, New Spain.
2 CONT **Catarina married Tomas Tadeo De La Garza SANCHEZ on Jun 1729 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, New Spain.
2 CONT ***Tomas was born 4 Jun 1709 in Cienega, Monterrey Nuevo Leon, Mexico, New Spain.
2 CONT *2. 68 F ii. Maria Isabel De La Garza Falcon Diaz URIBE.
2 CONT *3. 69 F iii. Maria Francisca De La Garza Falcon URIBE.
2 CONT *4. 70 F iv. Maria Rosa De La Garza Falcon URIBE.
2 CONT *5. 71 M v. Jose Luis Francisco De La Garza Falcon URIBE.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.wadefalcon.com/ColonialSpanishFamiliesOfLouisiana/DeLaGarzaFalcon.pdf
