2 CONC ol. 124, v., no. 67].  ...  This protolocolo is the '''will of Captain Miguel de la Garza Falcón'''.  It states that this document was witnessed by Lt. Nicolás de la Garza, bears no signature of the writer, and is '''dated 8 May 1
