2 CONC ría, Beatriz, Félix, '''Juan''', Pablo, and Manuel are identified.  Further, Juana's husband Antonio Rodríguez, Micaela's husband Fernando Sánchez de Zamora, and María's husband Alférez Juan de Villarreal are cited.
