2 CONT Apellido Prefix: Cap. CAPTAIN MIGUEL5 GARCIA-DAVILA (JUAN-JOSE4, MARGARITA3 CAVAZOS-DE-LA-GARZA, JUAN2 CAVAZOS-DEL-CAMPO, GABRIEL1 CAVAZOS) was born 1699, and died 1759. He married PETRA GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-ZAMORA, daughter of JUAN 
2 CONC GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO and CLARA SANCHEZ-DE-ZAMORA. She was born 1700, and died 1773.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MIGUEL GARCIA-DAVILA and PETRA GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO-Y-ZAMORA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. ALEXANDRO6 GARCIA-DAVILA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. EUFEMIA GARCIA-DAVILA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 140. iii. JOSE-ANTONIO GARCIA-DAVILA, b. Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon,Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JOSEPH-MIGUEL GARCIA-DAVILA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 141. v. JUAN-JOSE GARCIA-DAVILA, b. Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. MARIA-IGNACIA GARCIA-DAVILA, m. JOSEPH-NICOLAS GONZALEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. PEDRO-JOSEPH GARCIA-DAVILA, m. MARIA-OLAYA GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-LOZANO, July 29, 1754, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico; b. Abt. 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT 142. viii. ANA-MARIA GARCIA-DAVILA, b. 1723.
2 CONT
2 CONT 143. ix. MARIA-ROSALIA GARCIA-DAVILA, b. 1742.
2 CONT
