1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 214. BLAS5 VALDEZ-SANCHEZ (MARIA4 SANCHEZ-NAVARRO, MARIA3 DE-LA-FUENTE-MARTINEZ, FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) He married MARIA-DE-GUADALUPE FLORES-DE-ABREGO Jul
2 CONC y 12, 1717 in Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahuila, Mexico, daughter of MIGUEL FLORES-DE-ABREGO and MICHAELA DE-LA-GARZA-RENTERIA. She was born 1700 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
