1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 209. IDELFONZA6 GUAJARDO (JUAN5 MARTIN-GUAJARDO, ISABEL4 GARCIA-DEL-VALLE, PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born 1672 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. She married 
2 CONC CAPTAIN CRISTOBAL DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS June 17, 1690 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of DIEGO DE VILLARREAL and BEATRIZ DE-LAS-CASAS-NAVARRO. He was born 1649 in Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN CRISTOBAL DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS:
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1687 & 1690 he accompanied Alonso De Leon on the exploration of the Gulf Cost to the Nueces River, in what is now Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for IDELFONZA GUAJARDO and CRISTOBAL DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 139.
