1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From The Descendents of Don Juan Perez de Onate and Dona Osana Martinez de Gonzalez, Compiled by John D. Inclan
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/onate.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 155. JUANA-FRANCISCA11 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ (AGUSTINA10 SAENZ-SALDIVAR, ANTONIA9 DE SALDIVAR-Y-SALINAS, AGUSTIN8 DE SALDIVAR-SOSA, VICENTE7 DE SALDIVAR-Y-REZA, ANA-MARIA-MAGDELENA6 SALDIVAR-ONATE-MENDOZA, VICENTE5 DE SALD
2 CONC IVAR-Y-ONATE, MARIA4 DE ONATE, JUAN3 PEREZ-DE-ONATE, CRISTOBAL2 PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO, PEDRO1 DE BAEZA) 
2 CONT *was born 10 Feb 1716 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married (1) JOSEPH DE SOTO. 
2 CONT *She married (2) JUAN-AMADOR GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS 27 Nov 1732 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **son of JUAN GUERRA-CANAMAR and ELENA CAVAZOS-MONTEMAYOR. He was born 1703 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died Abt. 1752.
2 CONT ***Notes for JUAN-AMADOR GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 44. Source on his marriage is from the Index to the marriage investigations of the Diocese of Guadajara, Provinces of Coahuli
2 CONC a, Nuevo Leon, Nuevo Santander, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUANA-FRANCISCA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ and JUAN-AMADOR GUERRA-CANAMAR-CAVAZOS are:
2 CONT *1. i. INES12 GUERRA-CANAMAR, 
2 CONT **m. BARTOLOME CANTU, 13 Jul 1755, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 314. ii. JUANA-AGUSTINA GUERRA-CANAMAR, 
2 CONT **b. 08 Sep 1733, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. ELENA-JOSEFA-VICTORIANA GUERRA-CANAMAR, 
2 CONT **b. 12 Nov 1734, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
