1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 242. JUANA5 GARCIA-FLORES (ISABEL4 FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, JOSEPH3 DE-LA-FUENTES, FRANCISCA2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-NAVARRO-RODRIGUEZ, JUAN-FRANCISCO1 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO) 
2 CONT *was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
