2 CONT Spouse: Miguel DE LA GARZA. Isabel de ERIBE and Miguel DE LA GARZA were married after 10 July 1708.1388 Children were: Clara Maria DE LA GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Nicolas GONZALEZ de Ochoa. Isabel de ERIBE and Nicolas GONZALEZ de Ochoa were married after 2 April 1734.1387
