2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b65.html#P3611
2 CONT =======================
2 CONT 19. ISABEL5 DE URIBE-TREVINO (PHELIPE4 DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, ANTONIO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR, PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) was born 1690 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married (1) ALFEREZ M
2 CONC IGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-RENTERIA July 10, 1708 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON and GERTRUDIS SEPULVEDA-DE-RENTERIA. He was born 1680 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She
2 CONC  married (2) NICOLAS GONZALEZ-DE-OCHOA July 05, 1734 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of JOSEPH-DIEGO GONZALEZ-DE-QUINTANILLA and MARIA DE OCHOA-ELIZALDE. He was born 1677 in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ISABEL DE URIBE-TREVINO and MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-RENTERIA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to Marriages Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr.,
2 CONT
2 CONT Badine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 206.
