2 CONT 18. MARIA-ROSA5 DE URIBE-TREVINO (PHELIPE4 DE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-LOBO, ANTONIO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR, PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) She married JOSE RODRIGUEZ-VACA-SANCHEZ May 27, 1722 in Cadereyta Jim
