2 CONT 19. MARIA-ROSA4 GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA (GERTRUDIS3 DE-LA-GARZA, PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) was born 1676 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married CAPTAIN MARCOS-ALONSO DE TREVINO-RENTERIA June 03, 1700 in Sagrario M
2 CONC etropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of NICOLAS DE TREMINO-GONZALEZ and MARIA DE RENTERIA. He was born 1670 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
