2 CONT ISABEL4 GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA-FLORES (GERTRUDIS3 DE-LA-GARZA, PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) was born 1690 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married JUAN TREMINO-SALDIVAR November 29, 1707 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, s
2 CONC on of JUAN DE TREMINO-DIAZ-NAVARRO and JOSEFA DE SOSA. He was born March 29, 1682 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUAN TREMINO-SALDIVAR: In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, he is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso of Estrada, The Duke of Aragon. Page 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also, a descendent of the Onate-Zaldivar family of Zacatecas and New Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ISABEL GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA-FLORES and JUAN TREMINO-SALDIVAR:
