1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. CAPTAIN ANTONIO1 RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA1 was born 1660, and died 17 Dec 1728 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-Y-RENTERIA 08 Nov 1686 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo L
2 CONC eon, Mexico2, daughter of MIGUEL DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON and GERTRUDIS SEPULVEDA-DE-RENTERIA. She was born 1660.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for CAPTAIN ANTONIO RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 66.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANTONIO RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA and JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-Y-RENTERIA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, page 157. [36-1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Origin of the Surnames Garza and Trevino, by Tomas Mendirichaga Cueva.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANTONIO RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA and JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-Y-RENTERIA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. i. JOSE2 RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. ANA-MARIA-ROSA RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (1) CAPTAIN ANTONIO LOPEZ-DE-ORTEGON, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; m. (2) JUAN DE CARDENAS-PINILLAS, 19 Sep 1722, Saltillo, Coahuila, Me
2 CONC xico; b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANA-MARIA-ROSA RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA and JUAN DE CARDENAS-PINILLAS: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Pa
2 CONC ge 289.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. NARCISO RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. THOMASA FERNANDEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 05 Sep 1734, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1714, Pesqueria Chica, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for NARCISO RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 157.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. NICOLAS RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. v. SALVADOR RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. LUIS RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 29 Oct 1693, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. vii. BERNARDO RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1700; d. Bef. 03 Aug 1744, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. JOSE2 RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA (ANTONIO1 RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA)3. He married (1) FRANCISCA-JAVIERA DE TREVINO-AYALA 28 April 1722 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of GONZALO DE TREVINO a
2 CONC nd MARGARITA DE AYALA-Y-BENAVIDES. He married (2) CATARINA GARCIA-DE-TREVINO-GALVAN 06 Jul 1740 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOSE RODRIGUEZ-DE-QUIROGA-DE-LA-GARZA:
