2 CONT 77-8, 22-1,119-2, 84-17, 115-15, 115-8 IMIDG (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT 		iii.	Maria de la Garza14, married Diego de Villarreal II Abt. 1660; born Abt. 1636 in Nuevo Leon, Mex.; died 10 Aug 1705 in Valle de Salinas, N.L., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Maria de la Garza:
2 CONT 22-1 IMIDG (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Diego de Villarreal II:
2 CONT 22-1 IMIDG, 107-15IMIDG, 119-2, 25-2 IMIDG; Following Note from JDInclan==  ""Nombramiento de Capitán Diego de Villarreal de las Casas
2 CONT
2 CONT "El día 30 de Junio de 1687 se presentan ante el Sr. Agustín Echevers y Subisar, Marqués de San Miguel de Aguayo, Caballero de la Orden de Santiago, Vizconde de Santa Olaya, Gobernador y Capitán General del Nuevo Reyno de León y s
2 CONC us conquistas, estos 6 hijos legítimos del Capitán Diego de Villarreal y le presentaron sus contenidos como tales para efecto de ordenar sus heredades...Al compartirse la herencia de su padre el Capitán Diego de Villarreal...a los
2 CONC  hermanos Juan y Cristobal de Villarreal les cupo por ésta razón la Hacienda de la labor que llaman de Enmedio".
2 CONT    Así quedo limitada en toda su extensión geográfica la Hacienda de Enmedio que desde entonces se denominó Hacienda de Juan y Cristobal de Villarreal. Conocida como Hacienda de Enmedio, hoy Hidalgo, la Heredan Juan y Cristobal de
2 CONC  Villarreal, propiedad que se define "desde la Presa del Mortero, comprendiendo casas y molinos de Fundición hasta llegar al "Paso de las Moras".   (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT 		iv.	Magdalena de la Garza, born in Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico; married Ignacio Fernandez Aft. 03 Dec 1699 in Monterrey, N.L., Mexico; born in Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Magdalena de la Garza:
2 CONT 61-5 IMIDG (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Ignacio Fernandez:
2 CONT 61-5 IMIDG (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT 		v.	Isabel de la Garza, born Aft. 1635; died 18 Apr 1696 in Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico; married Captain Bernabe de Villarreal; born Abt. 1632; died 09 Aug 1694 in Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Isabel de la Garza:
2 CONT See 62-24 Marriage Invest(JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Isabel de la Garza:
2 CONT Burial: Aft. 18 Apr 1696, Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Bernabe de Villarreal:
2 CONT See 62-24 Marriage Invest & 99-3 IMIDG(JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Captain Bernabe de Villarreal:
2 CONT Burial: Aft. 09 Aug 1694, Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico
2 CONT
2 CONT 		vi.	Captain Gabriel de la Garza15, born Abt. 1648 in Monterrey, N. L., Mexico; died Abt. 1721; met (1) Maria Fernandez de las Casas; married (2) Petronila de Renteria de Sepulveda 12 Jul 1668 in Monterrey, N.L., Mexico; died 18 
2 CONC Jun 1674 in Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico; married (3) Clara de la Garza 17 Jul 1675; born Abt. 1653.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Gabriel de la Garza:
2 CONT 53-4, 32-2, 108-32IMIDG (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Maria Fernandez de las Casas:
2 CONT Vela, Vasquez & Guerra (Marriage Investigation..Guadalajara) show Maria as a Mistress of Gabriel de la Garza. (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT 		vii.	Elena de la Garza16, born Abt. 1650; died 25 Feb 1722; married Captain Diego Garcia de Sepulveda 01 Sep 1668 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, N.L.,  Mexico; born Abt. 1648; died 26 Oct 1719 in Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Elena de la Garza:
2 CONT 6-2, 29-5, 68.25, 70-9, 26-7 IMIDG (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Diego Garcia de Sepulveda:
2 CONT 26-7, 6-2 IMIDG) Aka Diego de Sepulveda & Diego Garcia de Sepulveda (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Captain Diego Garcia de Sepulveda:
2 CONT Burial: Oct 1719
2 CONT
2 CONT 		viii.	Captain Nicolas de la Garza17,18,19, born Abt. 1659 in Nuevo Leon, Mexico; married Maria de Trevino 21 Aug 1679 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, N.L., Mexico20; born in Monterrey,  N.L., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Nicolas de la Garza:
2 CONT (30-7,30-17, 116-7 IMIDG; 443Protocolo) Testamento de Beatriz Garcia names daughter Maria de Trevino, married to Nicolas de la Garza, as an heir and also names Nicolas as an executor of her Will (JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Maria de Trevino:
2 CONT 53-20 pg 239 "Marriage Investigations--Guadalajara" show that Maria de Trevino's mother is a "Maria", a sister of Margarita Saldivar de Sosa; Margarita's sister is recorded as Maria de Saldivar, wife of Bernardo Garcia (317-18-Pob
2 CONC ladores de Monterrey by Garmendia Leal & pgs 29 & 38-Reseacher PT Rodriguez InterNet) ; the analysis, however, appears to to be in error because  Protocolo no. 443-Cavazos, Testament of Beatriz Garcia,  shows that Maria de Trevino
2 CONC 's parents to be Beatriz Garcia and Jose de Trevino. (JMB)  
2 CONT
2 CONT 		ix.	Leonor de la Garza21, born Bef. 1660; died Bef. 30 Dec 1734; married Captain Santiago de Trevino Aft. 16 Jun 1690 in Monterrey, N.L., Mexico; born Bef. 1670 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Leonor de la Garza:
2 CONT 5-1; 7-34-IMIDG(JMB)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Captain Santiago de Trevino:
2 CONT 5-1, 58-4 IMIDG (JMB)5-1, 7-34--IMIDG-Resident "deste Reyno (Leon)"(JMB)
2 CONT
