2 CONT **d. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) MARIA-PETRA GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO, September 16, 1746, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1728, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (2) MARIA-RITA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, February 09, 1750, San Pedro, Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1732, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***d. 1781, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (3) MARIA-DE-LOS-DOLORES GUAJARDO-MONTES, January 14, 1782, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. April 12, 1744, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-IGNACIA GONZALEZ-MAYA-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1740; 
2 CONT **m. NICOLAS FLORES-TREVINO, August 13, 1761, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1739.
2 CONT *3. iii. MARIA-FRANCISCA-JAVIERA GONZALEZ-DE-AMAYA, 
2 CONT **b. Guadalajara, Jalisco, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. CAPTAIN JUAN-JOSEPH GOMEZ-DE-CASTRO; 
2 CONT ***b. Guadalajara, Jalisco, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. iv. TERESA GONZALEZ-DE-AMAYA, 
2 CONT **m. GREGORIO DEL BOSQUE-GUERRA-CANAMAR, January 05, 1758, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
