1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 15. MELCHOR-DE-LOS-SANTOS4 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA (TOMAS3 SANCHEZ-DURAN, FRANCISCO2 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, JUAN1 SANCHEZ-Y-ORTEGA) was born May 01, 1689 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died February 25, 1749/5
2 CONC 0 in Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (1) MARIA-RAIMUNDA DE-LA-GARZA-LOPEZ-PRIETO May 04, 1718 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and MARGARITA LOPEZ-PRIETO. Sh
2 CONC e was born 1700 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (2) MARIA-BERNARDA GARCIA-RODRIGUEZ July 06, 1740 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of BERNARDO GARCIA-MORALES and MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MO
2 CONC NTEMAYOR. She was born 1722.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MELCHOR-DE-LOS-SANTOS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 83.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARIA-BERNARDA GARCIA-RODRIGUEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Bernarda Garza Rodriguez Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 82.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MELCHOR-DE-LOS-SANTOS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA and MARIA-RAIMUNDA DE-LA-GARZA-LOPEZ-PRIETO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA-JOSEFA5 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, b. May 14, 1719, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (1) DOMINGO DE CASTRO-MIRELES-Y-CABALLERO, March 03, 1738, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 
2 CONC 1695; m. (2) ANTONIO-LEONARDO DE HOYOS, August 29, 1742, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 29. ii. MARIA-GERTRUDIS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MELCHOR-DE-LOS-SANTOS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA and MARIA-BERNARDA GARCIA-RODRIGUEZ are:
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. BERNARDO5 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA-GARCIA, b. 1741, Guadalajara, Mexico; m. ROSA RODRIGUEZ-BACA-CANO, February 09, 1763, Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
