1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 4) Diego Gonzalez Trevino III
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Born December 25, 1696 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died 1762.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) He married 1st wife Ana Maria de Trevino de la Garza August 9, 1716 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, NL, MX, daughter of Capt. Melchor de Trevino Diaz II and Apolonia de la Garza Renteria. b. 1698, d. 1719
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Children of Diego Gonzalez and Ana de Trevino are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Nicolas Antonio Gonzalez Trevino, b. 1717, Sagrario, Mexico; d. 1790 in Mier, MX. m. Ana Josepha Garica Guajardo in 1737.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Juana Efigenia Gonzalez Trevino, b. 1719; m. Juan Jose de Trevino in 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT d) In 1720, He married 2nd wife Maria de Ycasia Flores de la Garza, daughter of Marcos Flores de la Garza and Ana de Valle.
2 CONT
2 CONT e) Children of Diego Gonzalez and Maria Flores are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Maria Tadea Gonzalez Flores, b. 1721
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Maria de Jesus Gonzalez Flores
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Maria de la Concepcion Gonzalez Flores
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Maria Anastacia Gonzalez Flores
2 CONT
2 CONT v) Maria de la Candelaria Gonzalez Flores, b. 1731
2 CONT
2 CONT vi) Joseph Alonso Gonzalez Flores, b. 1733 (twin)
2 CONT
2 CONT vii) Maria Rosalia Gonzalez Flores, b. 1733 (twin)
2 CONT
2 CONT viii) Josephe Florencio Gonzalez Flores, b. 1734
2 CONT
2 CONT ix) Josephe Ildefonso Gonzalez Flores, b. 1736
2 CONT
2 CONT x) Diego Joseph Gonzalez Flores
2 CONT
2 CONT xi) Josephe Antonio Gonzalez Flores, b. 1739
2 CONT
2 CONT xii) Josephe Miguel Gonzalez Flores, b. 1742
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genforum.genealogy.com/vela/messages/105.html
