1 NOTE {geni:about_me} iii. GERTRUDIS DE TREVINO-VILLARREAL, b. 1707, Guajaco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. AGUSTIN RODRIGUEZ-SALDIVAR, January 09, 1725, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. April 07, 1698, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuev
2 CONC o Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/floresabrego.htm
2 CONT =======================
2 CONT Gertrudis de TREVIÑO1595 was born (date unknown). Citizen of Guajuco. Parents: Nicolas de TREVIÑO and Tomasa de VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Agustin RODRIGUEZ. Gertrudis de TREVIÑO and Agustin RODRIGUEZ were married after 9 January 1725.1595 Children were: Mariana RODRIGUEZ.
