1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 6. JOSE-SALVADOR5 CANALES-BENAVIDES (BLAS4 CANALES-MONTEMAYOR, JUAN3 CANALES, JOSE2, ANTONIO1) 
2 CONT *was born in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died December 04, 1768. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA-JOSEFA GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-CANTU May 21, 1728 in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of MARCOS GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-TREVINO and TOMASA DE-LEON-CANTU. She was born 1703 in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died December 09, 1775.
2 CONT ***Notes for JOSE-SALVADOR CANALES-BENAVIDES: He signed his last will and testament on December, 9, 1736. Source: Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos. Page 103.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSE-SALVADOR CANALES-BENAVIDES and MARIA-JOSEFA GONZALEZ-HIDALGO-CANTU are:
2 CONT *1. 15. i. ALFEREZ REAL JOSE-JOAQUIN6 CANALES-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO, 
2 CONT **b. 1730, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. January 24, 1811, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 16. ii. JOSEPH-IGNACIO-HERMAN CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. November 03, 1731, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. JUAN ANGEL CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. July 08, 1734, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. November 25, 1807.
2 CONT *4. iv. ANA MARIA JACOBA CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. August 02, 1737, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. January 25, 1794.
2 CONT *5. v. FRANCISCA PETRA CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. March 03, 1739/40, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. vi. JOSEPH FRANCISCO EUPHEMIANO CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. April 15, 1741, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. vii. MIGUEL EUGENIO CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. November 22, 1742, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. 17. viii. JOSE-JUAN-ANTONIO CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1743, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. April 21, 1792, Mier, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. ix. JOSEPH GABRIEL CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. March 26, 1744, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *10. 18. x. JOSEPH TOMAS CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. December 28, 1745, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Bef. 1802, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *11. xi. MARIA INES ROSALIA CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. January 27, 1747/48, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Aft. November 08, 1802, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for MARIA INES ROSALIA CANALES-GONZALEZ: She signed her last will and testament on November 8, 1802. Source: Restamentos de Monterrey, En resumen genealogico, by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos. 
2 CONT *12. xii. MARIA MANUELA CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. June 10, 1750, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *13. xiii. ANA INFANTA CANALES-GONZALEZ, 
2 CONT **b. September 11, 1758, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
