1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 4. MICHAELA5 CANALES-BENAVIDES (BLAS4 CANALES-MONTEMAYOR, JUAN3 CANALES, JOSE2, ANTONIO1) was born in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died January 29, 1774 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married NICOLAS SAL
2 CONC INAS-MORONES June 11, 1732 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of ANTONIO MORONES-SALINAS and FRANCISCA PEREZ-DE-DUENA. He was born in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MICHAELA CANALES-BENAVIDES and NICOLAS SALINAS-MORONES are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. i. MARIA-ANA-LUCIA6 SALINAS-CANALES, b. 1754.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. ANA-MARIA SALINAS-CANALES.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. CAYETANO SALINAS-CANALES, m. MARIA-LUGARDA SAENZ-DE-LA-SERNA, October 02, 1795, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1755, Vallecillo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. CRISOBAL SALINAS-CANALES, m. (1) APOLINARIA DE SILVA; m. (2) ANTONIA DE TREVINO-SAENZ, September 25, 1786, Montemorelos, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. JOSE-MIGUEL SALINAS-CANALES, m. MARIA-JOSEFA GONZALEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. RAFAEL SALINAS-CANALES.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. vii. PEDRO-JOSEPH SALINAS-CANALES, b. 1744, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 13. viii. JOSE-SALVADOR SALINAS-CANALES, b. Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. June 04, 1805, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/canales.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Not the daughter of Juan Canales, she was Juan's grand-daughter and daughter to Captain Blas Canales.
2 CONT
2 CONT ...................................
