1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 444. MARIA-LUISA8 TAMEZ-PRIETO (ANTONIO-PANTALEON7 DE TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ, MARIA-CATARINA6 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, FRANCISCO5, DIEGO4, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) was born 28
2 CONC  Aug 1749 in Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR 01 Dec 1772 in Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of JUAN-AGUSTIN SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA and ANNA-JOSEFA RODRIGUEZ-DE
2 CONC -MONTEMAYOR. He was born 28 Dec 1743 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR:
2 CONT
2 CONT Familias de Monterrey, Tomo 4, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 136.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA-LUISA TAMEZ-PRIETO and JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 16
2 CONC 9. [98-8]
2 CONT
2 CONT The book, Familias de Monterrey, Tomo 4, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal, list their marriage as having
2 CONT
2 CONT taken place on April 26, 1774. Page 135.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children are listed above under (380) Joseph-Antonio-de-Jesus Saldivar-Montemayor.
2 CONT
