1 NOTE {geni:about_me} x. MARIA-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT *b. May 21, 1724, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT *m. JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, October 24, 1750, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **b. 1720, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for MARIA-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA and JOSEPH RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 143
2 CONT
2 CONT she is daughter of
2 CONT *TOMAS4 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA (TOMAS3 SANCHEZ-DURAN, FRANCISCO2 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, JUAN1 SANCHEZ-Y-ORTEGA) 
2 CONT **was born April 23, 1680 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died Abt. 1739. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA-JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA-SOSA December 12, 1707 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JUAN DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA DE SOSA. 
2 CONT **She was born 1690
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings are:
2 CONT *1. 22. i. ANA-MARIA5 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, 
2 CONT **b. 1720.
2 CONT *2. ii. JOSEFA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **m. JOSE-PRUDENCIO GARCIA-DE-LAS-CASAS; 
2 CONT ***b. 1719, Laredo, Webb County, Texas. (sic: Laredo was founded in 1755)
2 CONT *3. 23. iii. JOSEPH-LEONARDO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. Aft. September 16, 1790, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT *4. 24. iv. CAPTAIN TOMAS-TADEO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, 
2 CONT **b. June 04, 1709, Cienega de Flores, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. January 21, 1796, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT *5. 25. v. ANA-MARIA-ROSA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, 
2 CONT **b. 1715.
2 CONT *6. 26. vi. JUAN-BAUTISTA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. 1718; 
2 CONT **d. June 07, 1778, Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 27. vii. MARIA-GERTRUDIS SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, 
2 CONT **b. November 27, 1718, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. 28. viii. AGUSTIN SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. February 17, 1722/23, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. ix. JOAQUIN SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, 
2 CONT **b. February 17, 1722/23.
