1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 380. JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS7 SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR (JUAN-AGUSTIN6 SALDIVAR-DE-LA-GARZA, ISABEL5 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, PETRONILA4 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIAN
2 CONC O MARTINS1) was born 28 Dec 1743 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married MARIA-LUISA TAMEZ-PRIETO 01 Dec 1772 in Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of ANTONIO-PANTALEON DE TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ and MARIA-ESTEFANA
2 CONC  PRIETO-AGUIRRE. She was born 28 Aug 1749 in Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR:
2 CONT
2 CONT Familias de Monterrey, Tomo 4, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 136.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-LUISA TAMEZ-PRIETO: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 16
2 CONC 9. [98-8]
2 CONT
2 CONT The book, Familias de Monterrey, Tomo 4, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal, list their marriage as having
2 CONT
2 CONT taken place on April 26, 1774. Page 135.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEPH-ANTONIO-DE-JESUS SALDIVAR-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-LUISA TAMEZ-PRIETO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. JUAN-JOSE-CASIMIRO8 SALDIVAR-TAMEZ, b. Mar 1774, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MARIA-IGNACIA-AGAPITA LOPEZ-PRIETO, 07 Jan 1795, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1777.
2 CONT
