2 CONC g widowed, married her first husband's nephew, Jose Fernando Vidaurri. Prior to her first husband's death, rumors making the rounds said that Maria Alejandra had slept not only with Fernando, but also with his brother Macario. Dur
2 CONC ing the investigation conducted by the church prior to their marriage, Macario denied ever having a carnal relationship with Maria Alejandra. Parents: Capt. Tomas Tadeo SANCHEZ and Catarina de ERIBE (Uribe).  Spouse: Bartolome Vas
2 CONC quez BORREGO. Maria Alejandra SANCHEZ and Bartolome Vasquez BORREGO were married on 12 August 1759 in Revilla, Guerrero, Tamaulipas, New Spain.608 Children were: Francisco BORREGO, Josefa BORREGO. Spouse: Jose Fernando VIDAURRI. M
2 CONC aria Alejandra SANCHEZ and Jose Fernando VIDAURRI were married on 17 June 1765 in Revilla, Guerrero, Tamaulipas, New Spain.731 Children were: Jose Alejandro VIDAURRI, Maria Encarnacion VIDAURRI, Maria Luz VIDAURRI, Fernando VIDAUR
2 CONC RI, Ildefonso VIDAURRI, Manuela VIDAURRI, Fabiana de VIDAURRI, Jose Leonardo VIDAURRI, Maria Josefa de Jesus VIDAURRI, Jose Manuel Martin VIDAURRI.
