2 CONT * 	E.	Maria Quilina SANCHEZ GONZALEZ m. 9 Nov 1808, in Laredo, Webb Co., TX, Jose Antonio JIMENEZ MENDIOLA, (son of Ignacio JIMENEZ and Estefana MENDIOLA).
2 CONT * 		F.	Pedro SANCHEZ GONZALEZ b. Laredo, Webb Co., TX, m. 22 Apr 1807, in Laredo, Webb Co., TX, Maria Ignacia GUTIERREZ MARTINEZ, b. Laredo, Webb Co., TX, (daughter of Juan Jose GUTIERREZ and Rosa Josefa MARTINEZ).
2 CONT * 	G.	Jose Encarnacion SANCHEZ GONZALEZ b. Laredo, Webb Co., TX, m. (1) 22 Jun 1807, in Laredo, Webb Co., TX, Francisca TREVIÑO SANCHEZ, b. Laredo, Webb Co., TX, (daughter of Manuel TREVIÑO and Manuela SANCHEZ) buried: Laredo, Web
2 CONC b Co., TX, m. (2) 4 May 1810, in Laredo, Webb Co., TX, Maria Lorenza GUTIERREZ MARTINEZ, (daughter of Juan Jose GUTIERREZ and Rosa Josefa MARTINEZ).
2 CONT
