1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 26. JUAN-BAUTISTA5 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA (TOMAS4 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, TOMAS3 SANCHEZ-DURAN, FRANCISCO2 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA, JUAN1 SANCHEZ-Y-ORTEGA) 
2 CONT *was born 1718, and 
2 CONT *died June 07, 1778 in Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married JUANA-MARIA DIAZ-TREVINO October 21, 1739 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of MIGUEL DIAZ and MARIA-GERTRUDIS DE TREVINO-DE-LA-GARZA. 
2 CONT **She was born July 08, 1716 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died in Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN-BAUTISTA SANCHEZ-DE-LA-GARZA and JUANA-MARIA DIAZ-TREVINO are:
2 CONT *1. i. MARGIL6 SANCHEZ-DIAZ.
2 CONT *2. ii. CRISTOBAL SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1740; 
2 CONT **m. (1) MARGARITA RODRIGUEZ-LEAL, October 07, 1776, Nuestra Sra de Santa Anna, Camargo, Tamaulipas, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (2) MARIA LEONOR CAVAZOS, August 20, 1822, Nuestra Sra del Refugio, Matamoros, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. ROSA-MARIA SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. September 26, 1740, Nuestra Sra. de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. iv. JOSEPH-LEONARDO SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. December 04, 1741, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. 52. v. JUANA-MARIA SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1755.
2 CONT *6. vi. JOSEFA SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1756, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. vii. ANTONIO SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1757, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. 53. viii. MARIA-DE-JESUS SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1758; 
2 CONT **d. February 01, 1798, Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. 54. ix. MARIA-MARGARITA SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1760.
2 CONT *10 55. x. JOSE-MIGUEL SANCHEZ-DIAZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1765, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT *In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, he is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso de Estrada, the Duke of Aragon, and the Royal Treasurer and Governor of New Spain, (Mexico) Also, the descendent of th
2 CONC e Onate-Zaldivar Family of Zacatecas and New Mexico. Page 83
2 CONT
2 CONT Listed as 43 years old, he and his family are listed on the July 23rd, 1757 census, Laredo, Webb County, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT On the 1780 census, he and his family are listed at Guerrero Viejo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
