2 CONT
2 CONT From the work of Michael A. Ayala (webcached 12/27/2012):
2 CONT
2 CONT http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/a/y/a/Miguel-A-Ayala-TX/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0182.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicolas Antonio Trevino Gonzalez (b. August 21, 1718, d. July 27, 1790)
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicolas Antonio Trevino Gonzalez 
2 CONT *(son of Diego Trevino Gonzalez and Ana Maria Trevino de la Garza) was born August 21, 1718 in Villa de Saltillo, MX, and 
2 CONT *died July 27, 1790 in Mier, Tamaulipas, MX. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Ana Josefa Garcia on May 18, 1737 in Cadereyta, MX.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Nicolas Antonio Trevino Gonzalez:
2 CONT *Received Porciones 20 & 21 (Tierra Blanc in Mier on the Mexican side of the Rio Grande River, adjudicated on July 21, 1767.
2 CONT *He bought Porciones 60 & 64 in 1790 in Starr County, TX (Rancho Los Arrieros), originally granted by Spain to Blas Farias and Jose Cruz de Pena, respectively. This was the year that the Gonzalez Family officially crossed the Rio 
2 CONC Grande River. In 1790, Texas was still part of Mexico, which was still ruled by Spain. The United States had just elected George Washington as its first President.
2 CONT *He married Ana Josefa Garcia on May 18, 1737 in Cadereyta, MX. She was born 1722 in Cerralvo, NL, MX and died 1801 in R Miguel Rios, Tamaulipas, MX.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children are:
2 CONT *i) Maria Manuela Gonzalez Garcia. b. 1738, d. May 22, 1815 in Cerralvo, NL, MX, m. Jose Joaquin Bazan Salinas, b.Cerralvo, NL, MX. She was not mentioned in the Final Will & Testament of her father because Jose Joaquin Bazan was n
2 CONC ot 100% Spaniard (part Indian).
2 CONT *ii) Jose Nicolas Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1738, Cerralvo, NL, MX, d. 1846, Mier, MX. m. Maria Francisca Marina Cantu in 1766.
2 CONT *iii) Maria Gregoria Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1741, Salinas Victoria, NL, MX, d. December 21, 1821 in Mier, MX, m. Jose Ygnacio Salinas in 1761.
2 CONT *iv) Juan Jose Mateo Gonzalez Garcia. b. 1743, d. 1825. m. Maria Clara Salinas in 1764. m. 2nd wife Maria Balbina de la Garza in 1791.
2 CONT *v) Jose Agustin Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1745. m. Maria de Jesus Cantu in 1771.
2 CONT *vi) Jose Marcelino Gonzalez Garica, b. 1747. m. Maria Juana Gertrudis Ramos in 1776.
2 CONT *vii) Jose Albino Gonzalez Garica, b.1752, d. February 14, 1793, Mier, Tamaulipas, MX. m. Maria Ana Lucia Salinas Canales.
2 CONT *viii) Maria Ana Josepha Viviana Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1753. m. Jose Miguel Salinas Canales.
2 CONT *ix) Maria Margarita Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1754, d. 1834. m. Jose Gregorio Saenz de Hinojosa.
2 CONT *x) Maria Francisca Javiera Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1755, d. 1825. m. Jose Santiago Pena.
2 CONT *xi) Jose Joachin Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1756, d. 1826. m. Maria Dorotea Chapa
2 CONT *xii) Juan Antonio Gonzalez Garcia, b. 1757, d. 1846. m. Maria Anastacia de Hinojosa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Posted by Jose Gonzalez in reply to Maria Catalina Vela, b. 1786 d. 1864 Mier, by Catherine de la Garza Millard. http://genforum.genealogy.com/vela/messages/105.html
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Nicolas Antonio Trevino Gonzalez and Ana Josefa Garcia: Marriage: May 18, 1737, Cadereyta, MX.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT   Re: Maria Catarina Vela b. 1786 d. 1864 Mier  Posted by: JOSE Gonzalez (ID *****2431) Date: July 09, 2007 at 09:46:20  In Reply to: Maria Catarina Vela b. 1786 d. 1864 Mier by Catherine de la Garza Millard  of 142  
2 CONT
2 CONT MY GENEALOGY
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Capitan Bartolome Gonzalez Olivares
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Arrived in Monterrey around 1645 as a miner in Valle de Los Salinas and was mayor of Monterrey in 1648.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) Born in 1598, Moron de la Frontera, Sevilla, Spain, died in 1672.
2 CONT
2 CONT c) First wife (1) was Catalina Gonzalez.
2 CONT
2 CONT d) He married (2) Isabel Gomez Esquivel on January 16, 1639.
2 CONT
2 CONT e) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Andres Gonzalez de Esquivel, born 1642.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Diego Gonzalez de Esquivel, born 1645.
2 CONT
2 CONT f) In 1652, he married (3) Ana Garcia de Quintanilla (b. 1625 and d. 1684), daughter of Lucas Garcia Rodriguez and Juliana Quintanilla Farias.
2 CONT
2 CONT g) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Captain Bartolome Quintanilla II, born 1654.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Alferez Nicolas Quintanilla, born 1656
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Sargento Mayor Joseph Quintanilla, born 1658
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Sargento Mayor Diego Gonzalez de Esquivel
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Born in 1645, Cuencame, Nueva Vizcaya, Mexico, and died on May 29, 1711.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) He married to Maria Petra Ochoa de las Ruelas y Rojo (daughter of Captain Martin Ochoa de Elejalde and Maria de las Ruelas de Rojo y Navarro) who was born in 1640, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. They lived in Villa de Cadereyta
2 CONC , Nuevo Leon, MX.
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Capt. Diego Gonzalez II
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Maria Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. Gregorio Fernandez de Tijerina
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Juana Gonzalez de Ochoa
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Isabel Gonzalez, m. Tomas de la Garza Falcon
2 CONT
2 CONT v) Juan Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. Maria Andrea de Leon
2 CONT
2 CONT vi) Alferez Joseph Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. Margarita Leal de Leon
2 CONT
2 CONT vii) Capt. Nicolas Gonzalez de Ochoa, m. (1) in 1699 to Nicolasa Flores de Abrego o Ayala and m. (2) in 1734 to Isabel de Eribe y Trevino
2 CONT
2 CONT viii) Salvador Gonzalez de Ochoa
2 CONT
2 CONT d) Then S.M. Diego Gonzalez married a second time to Magdalena de la Garza and had:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Francisco Gonzalez
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Maria Gonzalez
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Josefa Gonzalez
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Geronimo Gonzalez
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Captain Diego Gonzalez de Ochoa II
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Born in 1663, Valle del Carrizal, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, died on October 20, 1728, in Tamaulipas, MX.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) Married 1st wife Anastacia Trevino-Ayala on April 14, 1690. She was born in 1670 in Monterrey, NL, Mexico and died March 27, 1707.
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Catarina Gonzalez-Trevino, b. 1692, d. 1715. m. Alferez Pablo de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Antonia Gonzalez-Trevino, b.1693. m. Capt. Isidro de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Maria Gonzalez-Trevino, b. 1695, d. 1727. m. Manuel de la Garza Renteria.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Diego Gonzalez-Trevino III, b. December 25,1696, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 1762.
2 CONT
2 CONT v) Nicolas Gonzalez-Trevino, b. 1700. m. Ana de Jesus Mireles
2 CONT
2 CONT vi) Josepha Francisca Javiera Gonzalez-Trevino,m. Capt. Bartolome de Elizondo
2 CONT
2 CONT d) Also, married to Ana Maria Caballero Rodriguez de los Olivos on January 9, 1708, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; born about 1688, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, baptized in 1688, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, died in 1756.
2 CONT
2 CONT e) Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Juan Diego Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1709,Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. m. Antonia Margarita Martinez.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Maria Gertrudis Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1710; m. Pedro Jose de los Santos; b. Vecino de Boca de Leones.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Lucas Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1714; m. Maria Gertrudis Lozano, February 14, 1733/34; b. Abt. 1717,Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Jose Miguel Gonzalez Caballero, b. November 18, 1716, Monterrey Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v) Maria Ana Theresa Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1719,Sagario, MX; d. December 31, 1753. m. Gen. Jose Salvador Lozano.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi) Joseph Gonzalez Caballero, b. 1719; d. 1786.m. Maria Margarita Lozano
2 CONT
2 CONT vii) Lazaro Gonzalez Caballero, b. Abt. 1720; m. Maria Catarina Lozano, June 05, 1744; b. Abt. 1721,Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii) Maria Margarita Gonzalez Caballero, b. Abt.1723; m. Pedro Jose Cantu, April 26, 1738.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix) Ygnacio de Jesus Gonzalez Caballero, b. Abt. 1724, Hacienda Santa Teresa de los Higueras, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. m. Maria Apolinaria de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT x) Maria Catarina Gonzalez-Caballero, b. Abt.1725. m. Nicolas Joseph Lozano.
2 CONT
2 CONT f) In 1714, he bought La Hacienda de Santa Teresa de las Higueras. This estate is now known as the city of Higueras, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Diego Gonzalez Trevino III
2 CONT
2 CONT a) Born December 25, 1696 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died 1762.
2 CONT
2 CONT b) He married 1st wife Ana Maria de Trevino de la Garza August 9, 1716 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, NL, MX, daughter of Capt. Melchor de Trevino Diaz II and Apolonia de la Garza Renteria. b. 1698, d. 1719
2 CONT
2 CONT c) Children of Diego Gonzalez and Ana de Trevino are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Nicolas Antonio Gonzalez Trevino, b. 1717, Sagrario, Mexico; d. 1790 in Mier, MX. m. Ana Josepha Garica Guajardo in 1737.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Juana Efigenia Gonzalez Trevino, b. 1719; m. Juan Jose de Trevino in 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT d) In 1720, He married 2nd wife Maria de Ycasia Flores de la Garza, daughter of Marcos Flores de la Garza and Ana de Valle.
2 CONT
2 CONT e) Children of Diego Gonzalez and Maria Flores are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Maria Tadea Gonzalez Flores, b. 1721
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) Maria de Jesus Gonzalez Flores
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) Maria de la Concepcion Gonzalez Flores
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) Maria Anastacia Gonzalez Flores
2 CONT
2 CONT v) Maria de la Candelaria Gonzalez Flores, b. 1731
2 CONT
2 CONT vi) Joseph Alonso Gonzalez Flores, b. 1733 (twin)
2 CONT
2 CONT vii) Maria Rosalia Gonzalez Flores, b. 1733 (twin)
2 CONT
