2 CONC o Grande River. In 1790, Texas was still part of Mexico, which was still ruled by Spain. The United States had just elected George Washington as its first President.
2 CONT
2 CONT d) He married Ana Josefa Garcia on May 18, 1737 in Cadereyta, MX. She was born 1722 in Cerralvo, NL, MX and died 1801 in R Miguel Rios, Tamaulipas, MX.
