1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Someone through a merge had him connected  as a husband of - María Luisa Petrona del Carmen De la Serna Ocantos  her  family data is found here    http://www.genealogiafamiliar.net/getperson.php?personID=I70310&tre
2 CONC e=BVCZ gies spouses as: Juan José de Urquiza Costa  & Cipriano José de Urquiza Costa 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==================
2 CONT Jose Antonio FLORES189,1659,1660 was born about 1736.980 He died on 18 February 1803 at the age of 67.1032  Jose Antonio Flores was the owner of Porciones 38, 39, 40, and surrounding acreage, in Reynosa. He left a will dated Oct. 
2 CONC 27, 1803, in which he lists his marriages and his children. The Seabury papers erroneously show Maria Rita Longoria as the mother of 10 of the children. This obviously cannot be true because Jose Antonio was about 62 years old whe
2 CONC n he married Maria Rita and he died only 5 years later. His will names Isabel Salinas as the mother of all his children, except for the one child he had in his first marriage to Maria Gertrudis Serna.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jose Antonio Flores declares in his will that the children of his second marriage (with Isabel Salinas) are his universal heirs. He declares he owns 2 leagues for large stock and 6 leagues for small stock. The will is Expediente N
2 CONC o. 52, Vol. 4, Archives of Reynosa. Pedro T. Rodriguez has a copy of the will and provided me with the correct information as to the children of each of his spouses. Parents: Marcos FLORES and Maria Eufemia LOPEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria Gertrudis SERNA. Maria Gertrudis SERNA and Jose Antonio FLORES were married. Children were: Maria Gertrudis Serna FLORES.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Isabel SALINAS. Isabel SALINAS and Jose Antonio FLORES were married. Children were: Jose Urbano FLORES, Maria Ignacia FLORES, Jose Maria FLORES, Maria Marcelina FLORES, Maria Nicolasa FLORES, Manuel FLORES, Maria Manuela F
2 CONC LORES, Jose Segundo FLORES, Jose Antonio Eulogio FLORES, Maria Gertrudis FLORES, Maria Rita FLORES, Gabriel FLORES, Elugerio FLORES, Jose Jacinto FLORES.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria Rita LONGORIA. Maria Rita LONGORIA and Jose Antonio FLORES were married on 16 April 1798 in Camargo, Tamaulipas, New Spain.189,1661 This marriage produced no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b72.html#P1520
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Owner of Porciones 38, 39, 40, and other properties in Reynosa.
2 CONT
2 CONT On October 27, 1803, he signed his last will and testament. On this will he list his three marriages.
2 CONT (Research):http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/chapa.htm
