1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Agustin Xavier Chapa (0300) was born at Monterrey on September 10, 1700, [C601491-1289] the legitimate son of Jose Maria Chapa (0200) and Josefa Sanchez de la Barrera. Agustin Xavier Chapa (0300) married Antonia Gu
2 CONC axardo on February 4, 1727, [M601497-1029] at the Cathedral of Monterrey. Known children, as found in the Morman Micro-fiche of Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, are listed below:
